{"Title":"An Act relative to jurisdiction in paternity actions","BillNumber":"H3594","DocketNumber":"HD3069","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"JAG2","Name":"Judith A. Garcia","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JAG2","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T07:59:32.627"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"JAG2","Name":"Judith A. Garcia","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JAG2","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T07:59:32.6266667"},{"Id":"S_M1","Name":"Samantha Montaño","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/S_M1","ResponseDate":"2023-03-21T14:07:08.1166667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3594/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Garcia of Chelsea, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3594) of Judith A. Garcia and Samantha Montaño relative to jurisdiction in paternity actions.  The Judiciary.","DocumentText":"\tSection 39M of chapter 119 is hereby amended by adding the following subsection:-\r\n\t(i) For the purposes of a special findings determination pursuant to subsection (b), the following shall be considered abuse, neglect and abandonment of a child by their father: (i) the refusal of the father to acknowledge the child’s paternity; (ii) a finding that the child’s conception was a result of a sexual assault against the mother by the father; or (iii) a history of domestic violence by the father against the mother.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J19","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J19"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}